# Execution gates

- SKIP tecnico: `training` / `data` / `deploy` / `predict_error` / stop-win `EXEC_PAUSE`
- Soft sinal (escopo **1.1**): SSOT `signal_skip` — mini/cal/chop soft Kelly; **neg_edge** soft continuo (`neg_edge_deep_edge_floor` **−0.12** sob seed); sem flip pos-LOSS; sem hard SKIP de sinal no default
- **Fusao EV** (`execution_direction_fusion*`): argmax CALL/PUT; `fusion_block_when_tcn_pos_edge` **true**; soft EV fraco **0.40** / seed dual-EV&lt;0 **0.25**; telemetria `[GATES] || FUSION`
- Loss ML: container `aether-loss-classifier` → soft graduado; FLIP so com `p_loss>=0.90` + `veto_ready` + `flip_require_auto_learn` **true** (seed = SOFT); `FLIP_BLOCK:seed_candle|tcn_edge|seed|scale`
- `min_direction_margin` padrao **0.022** em **[0.015, 0.05]**; nao restaurar quality gate / Hurst/ADX/RSI/price_zone
- SCALE adapta lado + soft Kelly; **sem** SKIP por escala; `invert_exec_side` **false**
- EXEC_EMPTY so tecnico / Kelly pause; catalogo: `docs/binary-senior-playbook.md` + `docs/engineering-settings-ssot.md` + `docs/infra-docker.md`
